# Manifest for tests/uae/run_real_exe_test.sh - see that script's own
# header for the format. hexagon.exe is a real Amiga program (not one
# of gen_corpus.py's synthetic items), instrumented with
# exram_serial.h (see that file) to make it observable headlessly:
# SENTINEL is printed once, right after startup/library-open succeeds
# and before the main effect loop; HEARTBEAT_CHECK=1 means the program
# also loops forever printing '.' once per frame, so passing requires
# not just the sentinel but confirmed continued output afterward -
# distinguishing "booted and is still running" from "booted, then hung
# or crashed right after the sentinel".
SENTINEL="EXECRAM-HEXAGON-BOOT-OK"
HEARTBEAT_CHECK=1
